WEBVTT

00:05.686 --> 00:11.124
Dareni mo mienu deshou

00:13.094 --> 00:18.555
Me o tojite kimi o omou

00:18.632 --> 00:25.265
Itsuka de au

00:25.339 --> 00:31.574
Kaze no hana yo, Saa hiraku no yo

00:31.946 --> 00:38.215
Watashi no kono me ni haru o misete

00:38.619 --> 00:44.717
Kaze no hana yo, Saa hiraku no yo

00:44.992 --> 00:51.295
Sayonara fuyu no machi

00:51.565 --> 00:57.993
Kaze no hana yo, Saa hiraku no yo

00:58.205 --> 01:04.542
Watashi no kokoro ni haru o yonde

01:04.779 --> 01:11.116
Kaze no hana yo, Saa hiraku no yo

01:11.385 --> 01:17.881
Sayonara yukitachi yo

01:39.647 --> 01:42.616
Yume didn't come
home last night, did she?

01:44.819 --> 01:47.811
Darn. She's got
us all worried!

01:50.291 --> 01:52.225
There's more coffee.

02:05.239 --> 02:08.265
Looks like it's gonna be
hot again today.

02:19.753 --> 02:23.883
I'm sorry.
I couldn't save you...

02:25.226 --> 02:29.993
"What Is Important to Mages"

03:01.795 --> 03:03.729
Kikuchi Yume?

03:05.332 --> 03:06.458
Zennosuke-san?

03:06.634 --> 03:10.161
I knew it! It's Yume.
What are you doing here?

03:11.639 --> 03:12.970
I...

03:14.975 --> 03:15.634
Excuse me!

03:16.744 --> 03:17.335
Wait!

03:18.379 --> 03:21.837
What's going on?
Just calm down.

03:31.558 --> 03:35.426
Whenever we meet, it seems
you're always in trouble.

03:38.365 --> 03:41.357
Dress up and
come visit me sometime.

03:50.277 --> 03:52.871
So, the kitten didn't...

03:53.647 --> 03:55.547
I see...

03:58.285 --> 04:01.789
I couldn't do anything.

04:01.789 --> 04:02.983
Nothing.

04:06.961 --> 04:09.596
The kitten died
in your arms, right?

04:09.596 --> 04:12.394
That kitten was
happy at the end.

04:12.566 --> 04:13.033
What?

04:13.033 --> 04:17.970
I think that maybe the kitten
wanted you to see her off.

04:18.238 --> 04:20.103
So, don't be so sad.

04:28.148 --> 04:31.251
Ok, take five!
Drink lots of water.

04:31.251 --> 04:33.053
After that
it's the second half!

04:33.053 --> 04:34.042
- Yes!
- Yes!

04:34.755 --> 04:38.088
My mage action was
a nuisance, wasn't it?

04:38.258 --> 04:39.418
I'm sorry.

04:39.927 --> 04:41.061
What's this,
all of a sudden?

04:41.061 --> 04:46.829
Well, you haven't returned
to the soccer team, right?

04:49.269 --> 04:52.139
It was me who skipped soccer practice
and had an accident.

04:52.139 --> 04:54.775
It was me who injured a leg
and agonized over it.

04:54.775 --> 04:58.178
I gave much heartache to the people
around me, and I suffered, too.

04:58.178 --> 05:01.011
But, because I had
that experience...

05:04.251 --> 05:05.377
I am who I am today.

05:10.657 --> 05:11.291
- Kick it.

05:11.291 --> 05:12.459
- Kick it.
- What?

05:12.459 --> 05:13.448
Kick it back to me.

05:19.767 --> 05:21.428
I didn't think it was fair.

05:21.535 --> 05:23.127
Special Power is not fair?

05:23.537 --> 05:26.165
Not that. Special Power is
just Special Power, right?

05:26.273 --> 05:30.300
I just followed my heart.
That's all.

05:30.978 --> 05:35.108
But Takahashi-san regretted
requesting my mage action.

05:35.282 --> 05:38.085
Sometimes things don't go
the way you planned.

05:38.085 --> 05:42.681
If I'd listened better, I might
have used a better Special Power...

05:42.890 --> 05:45.051
Ok, then next time
listen better.

05:45.259 --> 05:46.860
No, that's not the point.

05:46.860 --> 05:49.329
Special Power frightens me,
so I can't use it.

05:49.329 --> 05:54.028
I'm a mage, but I don't
know what to do...

05:59.206 --> 06:02.709
When you used your Special Power
on me, what did you say?

06:02.709 --> 06:03.334
What?

06:05.913 --> 06:06.914
With all my...

06:06.914 --> 06:09.983
"With all your precious feelings
in your heart," right?

06:09.983 --> 06:13.120
You used your Power with
all your precious feelings, right?

06:13.120 --> 06:15.520
That's all that matters.

06:39.346 --> 06:43.248
- Give me the ball!
- I'm over here!

06:48.555 --> 06:50.455
Uh, Angela!

06:51.391 --> 06:52.949
Why are you here?

06:56.930 --> 06:58.363
Takahashi Mitsuko-san.

06:58.398 --> 06:59.500
What?

06:59.500 --> 07:01.491
She can receive visitors now.

07:01.535 --> 07:02.524
Really?

07:02.736 --> 07:03.964
Get in the car.

07:06.406 --> 07:09.569
No. I'll go on my own.
Thank you.

07:10.244 --> 07:13.213
Angela, thank
Master Chief Ginpun for me.

07:29.796 --> 07:30.785
Yume!

07:32.933 --> 07:35.265
Kera-san...
Milinda-san...

07:35.936 --> 07:39.173
Where have you been?
We've been worried sick!

07:39.173 --> 07:40.641
I'm sorry.

07:40.641 --> 07:43.911
Angela said that you
would definitely come here.

07:43.911 --> 07:45.445
You've been waiting for me?

07:45.445 --> 07:48.778
We couldn't rest
until we saw your face.

07:48.949 --> 07:49.938
I'm sorry.

07:50.217 --> 07:52.777
They say Takahashi-san
can have visitors.

07:54.821 --> 07:55.810
Right.

08:01.028 --> 08:02.162
Room 503
Takahashi Mitsuko

08:02.162 --> 08:04.765
Room 503
Takahashi Mitsuko
I'm really sorry.

08:04.765 --> 08:07.495
It's my fault that things
turned out this way.

08:10.404 --> 08:12.339
If I had listened to you
more carefully,

08:12.339 --> 08:15.934
maybe I could have used
a different mage action. I'm sorry.

08:16.843 --> 08:20.244
Yume-san, please look up.

08:23.383 --> 08:27.487
Afterwards my mother stayed
in the kitchen a long time.

08:27.487 --> 08:31.758
She started cutting up vegetables
and brought out a heavy mixing bowl.

08:31.758 --> 08:35.751
But that was no good.
I'm just old, I guess.

08:36.029 --> 08:40.022
That's right, Mother.
You caused a fire.

08:40.133 --> 08:45.839
I was happy. Thanks to
your mage action, Yume-san.

08:45.839 --> 08:50.435
Thanks to your Special Power,
I was filled with good energy.

08:50.544 --> 08:52.179
Mine?

08:52.179 --> 08:54.272
But you said,
"I regret making the request."

08:54.514 --> 08:59.508
What?
Ah, that's not what I meant.

09:00.687 --> 09:06.819
When I compared the new house
to my old body, I grew resentful.

09:07.027 --> 09:09.757
Yume-san,
thank you very much.

09:09.863 --> 09:13.765
Please do much, much more
of your wonderful mage work!

09:25.946 --> 09:28.540
I've decided.

09:29.549 --> 09:32.986
I'm quitting my goal
of becoming a mage.

09:32.986 --> 09:34.248
What?
What do you mean?

09:35.422 --> 09:37.424
I won't become
a certified mage.

09:37.424 --> 09:38.857
Kera-san!

09:39.760 --> 09:48.065
Wait a minute! What are you saying?
It was your dream to become a mage!

09:56.810 --> 09:59.973
Please don't say it's my fault
you're quitting being a mage.

10:00.480 --> 10:05.918
Just like it pains you to watch Boss,
it pains me to watch you.

10:10.924 --> 10:14.291
If you're not going to be
a certified mage, I'll quit, too.

10:14.428 --> 10:18.421
But I don't understand
Special Power anymore...

10:19.199 --> 10:21.929
Then how were
you using it up to now?

10:22.102 --> 10:23.729
Were you using it
half-heartedly?

10:23.904 --> 10:25.872
No, that's not it.
I was...

10:25.872 --> 10:28.102
You used it with all
your precious feelings, right?

10:29.609 --> 10:31.600
Is there any other way
to use it?

10:33.680 --> 10:36.950
You taught me how great it is

10:36.950 --> 10:39.953
to pour all my precious
feelings into what I do.

10:39.953 --> 10:42.513
Even when I serve a drink
to customers, it's different.

10:43.690 --> 10:47.126
It's not just me. Even Boss
changed since you came.

10:47.627 --> 10:48.929
What?

10:48.929 --> 10:51.765
"The new trainee can't
eat dinner alone," or

10:51.765 --> 10:54.301
"She uses Special
Power on her own," or

10:54.301 --> 10:57.634
"She's a handful."
He said those things happily.

11:00.073 --> 11:03.804
But now you're
going home soon,

11:04.211 --> 11:07.203
and Boss will go back
to living in the past...

11:07.481 --> 11:10.650
No. Oyamada-sensei
has a bright future.

11:10.650 --> 11:14.108
Just as there's a future for
every one of us, he also...

11:14.521 --> 11:16.921
Then teach Boss that!

11:19.159 --> 11:22.060
I wonder if
I could do that...

11:24.164 --> 11:25.893
Yume can do it!

11:58.765 --> 12:00.392
Masami-chan...

12:01.701 --> 12:06.104
feels that the fact he survived
was a punishment.

12:07.574 --> 12:11.476
Last night I was present
at a kitten's deathbed.

12:12.579 --> 12:16.709
I couldn't do anything...
but just hold her.

12:17.717 --> 12:19.878
I just felt sorrow
at seeing her off.

12:20.554 --> 12:24.791
But someone told me that
the kitten might have been happy

12:24.791 --> 12:27.093
to have died in my arms.

12:27.093 --> 12:28.082
Happy?

12:29.896 --> 12:33.889
Takako also died in
Masami-chan's arms.

12:35.001 --> 12:39.072
I've been telling
Masami-chan that Takako

12:39.072 --> 12:43.133
surely would have wanted
for him to be happy.

12:45.779 --> 12:50.739
But my words just weren't
enough to convince him of that.

12:59.092 --> 13:02.462
With your Special Power,
please tell Masami-chan that he...

13:02.462 --> 13:04.555
Masami-chan...

13:08.935 --> 13:10.596
Yes.

13:31.892 --> 13:32.881
Yume-chan...

13:32.993 --> 13:35.860
I've made you worry
and caused you trouble...

13:42.102 --> 13:43.637
I'm glad you're safe!

13:43.637 --> 13:45.839
Oyamada-sensei,
I'm so sorry.

13:45.839 --> 13:49.639
Why don't you take a shower
and eat something. Then we'll talk.

13:49.976 --> 13:53.680
Oyamada-sensei, please give me
the certification exam.

13:53.680 --> 13:54.681
Now?

13:54.681 --> 13:59.119
Yes. I'm sorry to be selfish,
but please.

13:59.119 --> 14:01.855
But the certification exam is to...

14:01.855 --> 14:06.893
My certification exam is
to use Special Power on you.

14:06.893 --> 14:08.383
I'll do my very best.

14:12.699 --> 14:14.326
Very well...

14:33.153 --> 14:36.556
I reported the start of the exam
to the Bureau of Mage Labor.

14:36.556 --> 14:40.560
We begin the certification exam
for trainee Kikuchi Yume.

14:40.560 --> 14:43.688
Yes. Thank you
for your care.

14:59.913 --> 15:02.939
With all my precious feelings
in my heart...

15:25.972 --> 15:29.542
Come on, Mommy.
Please...

15:29.542 --> 15:30.210
- What is it?

15:30.210 --> 15:31.811
- What is it?
- Isn't dinner ready?

15:31.811 --> 15:33.113
It's almost ready.

15:33.113 --> 15:35.741
When is "ready" ready?

15:41.921 --> 15:42.717
I'm home!

15:43.023 --> 15:45.150
Oh, Daddy's home!

15:45.325 --> 15:47.384
Welcome home!

15:48.628 --> 15:50.430
Here's something for you.

15:50.430 --> 15:54.134
Wow, it's peaches!
Mommy, can I eat them?

15:54.134 --> 15:55.123
Aren't you forgetting something?

15:55.402 --> 15:57.666
Oh, we put it on the altar
for offering first.

15:57.837 --> 15:59.828
Right. You can
eat them after that.

16:00.206 --> 16:01.195
Ok!

16:12.686 --> 16:15.555
Masami-kun,
I'm really happy again today,

16:15.555 --> 16:19.047
because I'm living each day
to the fullest on your behalf.

16:19.325 --> 16:21.316
Now can I eat them?

16:21.594 --> 16:22.395
All right.

16:22.395 --> 16:23.384
Yay!

16:23.830 --> 16:26.799
- Takako...
- Now thank your Big Brother Mage...

16:32.238 --> 16:35.575
If it was you that died in
the accident, and I survived,

16:35.575 --> 16:37.566
I would have
led a life like that.

16:38.044 --> 16:40.171
Do you think that's heartless?

16:42.182 --> 16:44.050
It might be heartless,

16:44.050 --> 16:49.682
but living my life to the fullest
would be a token of my love for you.

16:49.889 --> 16:51.491
That would be
just like you, Takako.

16:51.491 --> 16:53.356
Anyone can do it.

16:54.994 --> 16:56.655
You're not making
enough of an effort.

16:58.832 --> 17:01.824
Do you remember
my last words?

17:02.302 --> 17:03.997
Your last words?

17:04.304 --> 17:07.296
You must have heard me.
Try to remember.

17:07.507 --> 17:10.499
Your last words...

17:38.204 --> 17:40.195
Thank you...

17:50.817 --> 17:52.808
It was an accident.

17:53.386 --> 17:54.375
But...

17:54.988 --> 17:58.981
Reality is always a little bitter.
Accept that.

18:00.226 --> 18:04.230
Don't live as though
you're dying.

18:04.230 --> 18:09.469
Enjoy your life.
When you suffer, I suffer.

18:09.469 --> 18:14.073
But I can't forget you.
If it's not you, it's no one.

18:14.073 --> 18:16.476
No. You're all right now.

18:16.476 --> 18:18.068
Why?

18:19.813 --> 18:23.476
Because I've just conveyed
my last words to you.

18:24.717 --> 18:30.678
Although my time here is over,
I'm always with you.

19:01.120 --> 19:03.111
Yume-chan...

19:03.389 --> 19:04.583
Yes.

19:13.733 --> 19:15.257
It was an excellent mage action.

21:28.935 --> 21:30.036
Take care.

21:30.036 --> 21:33.699
Yes. Thank you very much
for everything.

21:35.108 --> 21:36.666
No, thank YOU.

21:37.710 --> 21:41.510
Oyamada-sensei,
I think I'm going to cry.

21:42.115 --> 21:44.350
Yume-chan and tears
don't go together.

21:44.350 --> 21:47.342
But, this is farewell...

21:47.487 --> 21:48.852
Come again...

21:50.857 --> 21:53.792
Any time...
I'm waiting for you.

21:55.194 --> 21:57.628
Yes. I'll come again.

21:57.663 --> 22:00.097
Odakyu Line
Shimo-Kitazawa Station

22:00.133 --> 22:02.624
I'll definitely come back.

22:43.142 --> 22:45.372
With all my precious feelings
in my heart...

22:52.552 --> 22:59.116
Furikaereba ima demo soko ni

23:01.894 --> 23:08.527
Oikaketeta mirai ga atta

23:10.236 --> 23:19.372
Boku no kokoro ni aru taisetsu na mono

23:19.479 --> 23:24.314
Mada mienai ao to

23:25.384 --> 23:32.085
Nagareru kumo ni negatta

23:34.994 --> 23:37.087
Under the Blue Sky

23:37.363 --> 23:44.132
Ano hi bokura ga egaita yume kara

23:44.403 --> 23:51.172
Samenai you ni tomaranai you ni

23:53.946 --> 23:55.880
Under the Blue Sky

23:56.082 --> 24:02.783
Kagayaki nagara aruiteikou yo

24:03.322 --> 24:09.283
Owaranai tabi wa tsuzuku
